OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: the first-start wizard does not probe the network.
Its UDP probe (a datagram socket on ports 10110, 2000 and 1458, waited on
for a second each) never returned in the lab and the wizard hung on
"Looking for UDP data feeds...". The UDP, TCP, Signal K and GPSD probes
are left out; USB is still scanned, and network sources are set up in
Options, Connections as before.

